> integrationWeightsLeft(X1, xind2, leftWeight = "zero")
     [,1] [,2] [,3] [,4] [,5]
[1,]  0.5  0.1  0.2  0.4  0.3
[2,]  0.5  0.1  0.2  0.4  0.3
